        <title>Enhancing the technological quality and α-tocopherol bioaccessibility of non-fat goat yogurt fortified with wheat germ oil microparticles stabilized by octenyl succinic anhydride-modified starch and wheat gluten protein hydrolysate | Food Science and Biotechnology | Springer Nature Link</title>

        
            
    
