    <script type="application/ld+json">{"mainEntity":{"headline":"Enhancing the technological quality and α-tocopherol bioaccessibility of non-fat goat yogurt fortified with wheat germ oil microparticles stabilized by octenyl succinic anhydride-modified starch and wheat gluten protein hydrolysate","description":"Concerns regarding saturated fat intake have increased interest in low- and non-fat dairy products; however, milk fat removal from goat yogurt may impair texture and reduce fat-associated bioactives. Functional oil microparticles can restore these compounds while maintaining yogurt stability. In this study, wheat germ oil (WGO) microparticles prepared using octenyl succinic anhydride-modified starch (OSAS) and wheat gluten protein hydrolysate (WGPH) were investigated as functional fortifiers. Increasing WGPH content significantly enhanced water-holding capacity, oxidative stability, texture, and antioxidant activity (reaching 76.33%). Microstructural analysis revealed that the control yogurt had a porous protein network, whereas fortified samples, particularly those with WGPH, exhibited a denser and more compact structure. In vitro digestion indicated more controlled lipid digestion and higher α-tocopherol bioaccessibility due to better interfacial stability from OSAS and WGPH. WGPH also enhanced umami taste. Overall, OSAS-WGPH microparticles improved structural, functional, and nutritional properties while negatively affecting sensory acceptability at high WGPH levels. ","datePublished":"2026-09-15T00:00:00Z","dateModified":"2026-09-15T00:00:00Z","pageStart":"1","pageEnd":"21","sameAs":"https://doi.org/10.1007/s10068-026-02297-4","keywords":["Goat milk","Wheat gluten protein hydrolysate","Non-fat yogurt","Microparticles","Wheat germ oil","Modified wheat starch","Food Science","Nutrition"],"image":["https://media.springernature.com/lw1200/springer-static/image/art%3A10.1007%2Fs10068-026-02297-4/MediaObjects/10068_2026_2297_Figa_HTML.png","https://media.springernature.com/lw1200/springer-static/image/art%3A10.1007%2Fs10068-026-02297-4/MediaObjects/10068_2026_2297_Fig1_HTML.png","https://media.springernature.com/lw1200/springer-static/image/art%3A10.1007%2Fs10068-026-02297-4/MediaObjects/10068_2026_2297_Fig2_HTML.jpg","https://media.springernature.com/lw1200/springer-static/image/art%3A10.1007%2Fs10068-026-02297-4/MediaObjects/10068_2026_2297_Fig3_HTML.png","https://media.springernature.com/lw1200/springer-static/image/art%3A10.1007%2Fs10068-026-02297-4/MediaObjects/10068_2026_2297_Fig4_HTML.png","https://media.springernature.com/lw1200/springer-static/image/art%3A10.1007%2Fs10068-026-02297-4/MediaObjects/10068_2026_2297_Fig5_HTML.png"],"isPartOf":{"name":"Food Science and Biotechnology","issn":["2092-6456","1226-7708"],"@type":["Periodical"]},"publisher":{"name":"Springer Nature Singapore","logo":{"url":"https://www.springernature.com/app-sn/public/images/logo-springernature.png","@type":"ImageObject"},"@type":"Organization"},"author":[{"name":"Amr M. Bakry","url":"http://orcid.org/0000-0001-5638-8882","affiliation":[{"name":"New Valley University","address":{"name":"Dairy Science Department, Faculty of Agriculture, New Valley University, El-Kharga, Egypt","@type":"PostalAddress"},"@type":"Organization"}],"email":"amr.bakry@agr.nvu.edu.eg","@type":"Person"},{"name":"Jihong Huang","affiliation":[{"name":"Henan University","address":{"name":"State Key Laboratory of Crop Stress Adaptation and Improvement, College of Agriculture, Henan University, Kaifeng, China","@type":"PostalAddress"},"@type":"Organization"}],"@type":"Person"},{"name":"Bodour Ibrahim Al Shik Mubarak","affiliation":[{"name":"King Faisal University","address":{"name":"Department of Food and Nutrition Science, College of Agricultural and Food Sciences, King Faisal University, Hofuf, Saudi Arabia","@type":"PostalAddress"},"@type":"Organization"}],"@type":"Person"},{"name":"Marwa Ezz El-Din Ibrahim","affiliation":[{"name":"King Faisal University","address":{"name":"Department of Food and Nutrition Science, College of Agricultural and Food Sciences, King Faisal University, Hofuf, Saudi Arabia","@type":"PostalAddress"},"@type":"Organization"}],"email":"msoilman@kfu.edu.sa","@type":"Person"}],"isAccessibleForFree":false,"hasPart":{"isAccessibleForFree":false,"cssSelector":".main-content","@type":"WebPageElement"},"@type":"ScholarlyArticle"},"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"WebPage"}</script>

        
        
